    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71570" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξερόν</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>terra firma,</i> once in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτὶ ξερὸν ἠπείροιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.402
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτὶ ξερὸν ἔλθ᾽ ἀπὸ
			πέτρας</span> to the <i>mainland,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.304
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phan.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.322
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ ξερόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					704
				</span></i>
			. (Cogn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχερός</span> rather
			than with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξηρός.</span>)</div>
